  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Valuing Women&apos;s Work, Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The resources will support a consultancy to various activities towards the design of the Valuing Women&apos;s Work programme strategy document.  Some of the activities include, mapping of strategic stakeholders, data collection and analysis, literature review and convening programme design workshops with strategic partners for this programme.</narrative>
